# T4 · T-92 로그 창(10-05 §77 · f2f2f1d): view.log 토글 → 창 열림 · 파일 복사 뒤 ops 줄이 버퍼에 → 다시 토글 = 닫힘.
id: log-window
title: 로그 창 토글 · 작업 줄 기록
tree: file a.txt 3
tree: dir sub
settings: ui.lang=en
cmd: @ready:view.log
cmd: @ready:layout.dump:<out>/open.txt
cmd: @ready:list.select:1
cmd: @ready:edit.copy
cmd: @ready:nav:<root>/sub
cmd: @ready:edit.paste
cmd: @ready:ops.wait
cmd: @ready:log.dump:<out>/log.txt
cmd: @ready:view.log
cmd: @ready:layout.dump:<out>/closed.txt
cmd: @ready:quit
check: open.txt: log true
check: closed.txt: log false
check: log.txt: transferred 1
